eration from \u201crusty\u201d to \u201cstraight from the factory\u201d and more than a hundred \u201cattachments\u201d.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Install stock, attach a bayonet and attack closely, explode with a grenade launcher, use different sights (collimator, optical, digital, nvs, thermal imaging), install silencers and flame arresters, change magazines. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FULL IMMERSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079170/extras/c6aefb78b532e8ff38970d6685f150fe.poster.avif?t=1752713610\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079170/extras/c6aefb78b532e8ff38970d6685f150fe.webm?t=1752713610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079170/extras/c6aefb78b532e8ff38970d6685f150fe.mp4?t=1752713610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>An honest body with its own limitations has been implemented, armor can be changed, all interactions with the environment are animated, parkour has been implemented. The character has 25 survival states (hunger, fatigue, radiation, etc.) which also has visual effects.</p>",
